<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>

    <!-- Bootstrap 5.3.3 CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Bootstrap Icons 1.11.3 -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <!-- Google Font: Inter -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Dedicated Admin Stylesheet -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css">

    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body.invalid-page {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064e3b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            width: 100%;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .invalid-card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 440px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .invalid-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #991b1b 0%, #b91c1c 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 26px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .invalid-logo-container {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 76px;
            height: 76px;
            background: #0f172a;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            border-radius: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            padding: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .invalid-logo-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
            display: block;
        }

        .invalid-title {
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        }

        .invalid-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.8125rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            margin-top: 6px;
            line-height: 1.45;
        }

        .invalid-body {
            padding: 28px 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .action-btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669 0%, #047857 100%);
            border: none;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .action-btn-primary:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #047857 0%, #065f46 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.35);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .invalid-footer-links {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 16px 24px 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="invalid-page">

<div class="container d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center min-vh-100 py-3 px-3">
    <div class="invalid-card">
        
        <div class="invalid-header">
            <div class="invalid-logo-container">
                <img 
                    src="/images/hero/logo-dkm-muhajirin.png" 
                    alt="Logo Masjid Ittihadul Muhajirin" 
                    class="invalid-logo-img">
            </div>
            <h2 class="invalid-title">Tautan Tidak Valid</h2>
            <div class="invalid-subtitle">
                Keamanan Akun Pengurus DKM Crystal
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="invalid-body">
            <div class="mb-4">
                <div class="d-inline-flex p-3 rounded-circle bg-danger-subtle text-danger mb-3">
                    <i class="bi bi-shield-x fs-1"></i>
                </div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Tautan Pemulihan Tidak Dapat Digunakan</h5>
                <p class="text-secondary small mb-0" style="line-height: 1.55;">
                    <%= message || "Tautan pemulihan ini telah kedaluwarsa, telah digunakan, atau format tautan tidak sesuai." %>
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 border text-start small mb-4" style="font-size: 0.775rem; line-height: 1.5;">
                <div class="fw-bold text-dark mb-1"><i class="bi bi-info-circle text-primary"></i> Demi keamanan akun:</div>
                <ul class="mb-0 ps-3 text-secondary">
                    <li>Setiap tautan pemulihan hanya berlaku <strong>15 menit</strong>.</li>
                    <li>Tautan otomatis hangus setelah digunakan 1 kali.</li>
                    <li>Silakan ajukan permohonan baru untuk mendapatkan tautan aktif.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <a href="/lupa-password" class="btn action-btn-primary w-100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat fs-5"></i>
                <span>Ajukan Pemulihan Ulang</span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="invalid-footer-links">
            <a href="/login" class="text-decoration-none small text-muted d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-1">
                <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Kembali ke Halaman Login
            </a>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>

